{"Title":"An Act to remove woody biomass from the greenhouse gas emissions standard for municipal lighting plants ","BillNumber":"S2136","DocketNumber":"SD2183","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"A_G0","Name":"Adam Gomez","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/A_G0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:12:57.253"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"A_G0","Name":"Adam Gomez","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/A_G0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:12:57.2533333"},{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:13:51.2933333"},{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-19T11:52:25.7733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2136/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Gomez, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2136) of Adam Gomez and Orlando Ramos for legislation to remove woody biomass from the greenhouse gas emissions standard for municipal lighting plants.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 11F3/4 of Chapter 25A of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, and as amended by Section 34 of Chapter 8 of the Acts of 2021, is hereby further amended in clause (i) of subsection (c) by striking the words “biomass fuel; and (11)”.  \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}